  "content": {
    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n22 hours ago\nApple Knocks Big Tech Rivals for Making 'AI for the Sake of AI'\nAs he announced Apple's new AI services, senior VP Craig Federighi was critical of other companies' pursuit of AI.\n\"Some appear to be racing forward, seemingly pursuing AI for the sake of AI. without clear regard for the people--all of us--that it's ultimately meant to serve,\" he said.\n\"Today, many AI providers talk about privacy, but by default, most of them retain your personal interactions, leaving the onus on you to defend your privacy. \"",
    "text_blocks": [
      "CONCLUDED",
      "Last Updated:",
      "22 hours ago",
      "Apple Knocks Big Tech Rivals for Making 'AI for the Sake of AI'",
      "As he announced Apple's new AI services, senior VP Craig Federighi was critical of other companies' pursuit of AI.",
      "\"Some appear to be racing forward, seemingly pursuing AI for the sake of AI. without clear regard for the people--all of us--that it's ultimately meant to serve,\" he said.",
      "\"Today, many AI providers talk about privacy, but by default, most of them retain your personal interactions, leaving the onus on you to defend your privacy. \""
    ],
